acp-rs-scraper (1.26.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Key downloaded media by URL without the presigned query; no duplicate
    attachments across scrapes or in DB exports (1.26.1).
  * Complete truncated post/comment bodies from thread pages, keep paragraph
    breaks, add --refetch-truncated (1.26.0).
  * Label posts vs replies in exports (1.25.1).
  * --format accepts several formats (json,html or repeated) in one run (1.25.0).
  * Redact CSRF/session secrets in --debug wire logs (1.24.0).
  * Fail on unknown nicks instead of scraping Trending; never write empty exports (1.23.0).
  * Run logs with --enable-logging (1.22.0) and earlier changes: see CHANGELOG.md.

